caption: Default Mastery shape
engine-rule: default-mastery-shape

Regular Mastery has no minimum character-point investment requirement. A Regular Tradition should require:

Several spells at effective skill 20+.

Meaningful breadth across the Tradition’s allowed scope.

Completion of multiple prerequisite chains.

A Tradition-specific demonstration such as invention, enchantment, major casting, or creation of a formal spell record.
